	bʱ dʱ ɡʱ > pʰ tʰ kʰ
	s > h / #_
	s > h / V_V
	t > t͡s / _i
	j > h
	kʷ kʰʷ ɡʷ > t tʰ d / _E
	kʷ kʰʷ ɡʷ > p pʰ b / _{a,o,C}
	kʷ kʰʷ ɡʷ > k kʰ ɡ / _u
	kʷ kʰʷ ɡʷ > k kʰ ɡ / u_
	t͡s > s
	h > ∅
	ɑ:[+ long] > æ:[+ long]
	Vns > V:[+ long]s
	n > ∅ / _s
	t͡ʃ > t / #_
	t͡ʃ > t:[+ long] / medial
	w > ∅
	{ u, u:[+ long] }(j) > { y, y:[+ long] }(j)
	æ:[+ long] > ɛ:[+ long] (includes diphthongs)
	ej ow > e:[+ long] o:[+ long]
	e:[+ long] > i:[+ long] / _C
	j > ∅ / V:[+ long]_
	e:[+ long] > i:[+ long] / _V
	ɛ:[+ long] > e:[+ long]
	ɑj > ɛ:[+ long]
	h > ∅
	oj > øj
	øj > yj
	yj > y:[+ long]
